  moveMessage: Press WASD or arrow keys to Move.
  interactMessage: Press E to Interact with Objects, NPCs or Entrances/Exits.
  tokensMessage: Tokens represent topics that you can discuss. Press 1 or click on
    the Token to selecte/deselect it and E to confirm your choice. Press ESC to exit
    the interaction.
  journalMessage: When you discover a Clue, it appears in your Journal. Press TAB
    to open/close it.
  deductionMessage: When you gather enough Clues, you can try to solve the Deduction.
    Press SPACE to open/close it. Choose options from drop-down menus. Some of them
    will be scrollable.
  newTokenMessage: You unlocked a new Token. You can try it out on an NPC.
  twoTokensMessage: Now you have two Tokens. You can still choose one or both at
    the same time to get intersecting information.
  thirdTokenMessage: You can only choose up to two tokens at the same time.
